OL,3,GNEWSAHorse riding charity aims to offer
OL,4,A'freedom and joy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that helps people with
OL,7,Fphysical and mental health conditions
OL,8,Fbuild strength and confidence through
OL,9,Fhorse riding has been nominated for a
OL,10,FBBC Make a Difference Award.
OL,12,FWatershed Riding for the Disabled
OL,13,FAssociation (RDA) is based in the
OL,14,Fvillage of Coates, near Cirencester,
OL,15,Fand has been nominated in the Active
OL,16,Faward category.
OL,18,FThe charity was set up in 1993 and
OL,19,Fhelps people of all ages through horse
OL,20,Friding,  animal care and offering a
OL,21,Fsense of community.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
