OL,3,GNEWSAHorse riding charity aims to offer
OL,4,A'freedom and joy'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have riders who come, and yes we
OL,7,Fput them on a horse, but it's more than
OL,8,Fphysical activity, it's emotional
OL,9,Fconnection, it's freedom and it's joy,"
OL,10,Fsaid trustee and instructor Kathy
OL,11,FMottershead.
